+  cannot apply the requested limit. The V7 profile additionally accepts only
+  the observed `overlay2` driver with XFS backing and verifies the exact size
+  during policy apply and start; its admission remains closed until target-host
+  exhaustion and restart probes pass. The supported overlay2 configuration
